1
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:39,566
近来各州府铺张

2
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,833
开支一笔接一笔

3
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,766
跟美剑星、瓯梦星的战事又没停

4
00:01:03,166 --> 00:01:04,966
下一笔军费还等着拨

5
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,133
国库已经见底了

6
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,800
陛下怎么办

7
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:15,733
知道了

8
00:01:25,033 --> 00:01:26,633
陛下不必忧心

9
00:01:27,133 --> 00:01:28,233
我有一计

10
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:31,733
请未央大人拨我一千亿

11
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:35,566
我能从星契市场里榨出10万亿

12
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,100
噬魂大人

13
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,600
1,000亿怎么变成10万亿

14
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:47,766
这出戏得请狼王和鳄王一起唱

15
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:52,800
我们先在狼王的交易所买入星契

16
00:01:54,133 --> 00:01:57,100
再一批一批压价卖出去

17
00:01:58,133 --> 00:01:59,800
咱们赔1,000亿

18
00:02:00,433 --> 00:02:04,633
全市场的账面就能少掉30万亿

19
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,900
账面上少了30万亿

20
00:02:08,833 --> 00:02:09,766
钱呢

21
00:02:11,833 --> 00:02:13,533
得等他们自己卖

22
00:02:14,433 --> 00:02:15,833
10个持有人里

23
00:02:16,033 --> 00:02:17,900
少说有7个熬不住

24
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,133
等他们割了肉

25
00:02:21,766 --> 00:02:23,766
光百姓认下的亏损

26
00:02:24,433 --> 00:02:25,766
照我的估算

27
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,166
就够10万亿

28
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:37,400
市面上的购买力折了多少

29
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:40,400
央行就照数补发

30
00:02:45,933 --> 00:02:47,833
各路豹王爷也在场里

31
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:51,200
他亏了来找我怎么办

32
00:02:53,566 --> 00:02:55,733
狼王手上的仓位又怎么算

33
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,533
百姓的钱三七分成

34
00:02:59,133 --> 00:03:01,400
豪绅的钱如数奉还

35
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,133
鳄王大人可以拟一张名单

36
00:03:06,766 --> 00:03:08,300
新印的十万亿

37
00:03:08,766 --> 00:03:10,433
三万亿进国库

38
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:13,300
7万亿按名单拨

39
00:03:14,633 --> 00:03:17,000
各路王爷和狼王亏了多少

40
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,200
如数补足

41
00:03:22,566 --> 00:03:25,733
只是这桩买卖做过一回

42
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:30,433
下一回得需要三五年来让人遗忘

43
00:03:31,766 --> 00:03:32,933
那又怎样

44
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,200
一回挣够5年的钱

45
00:03:38,833 --> 00:03:42,733
剩下4年上班摸鱼不好吗

46
00:03:44,333 --> 00:03:46,200
正好花夏币升值

47
00:03:46,833 --> 00:03:48,566
我去海外狩猎

48
00:03:51,966 --> 00:03:56,966
留在花夏星的小狼们也正好休养几年

49
00:04:01,333 --> 00:04:02,733
宴席照办

50
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:39,566
Recently, state capitals have been extravagant

51
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,833
one expense after another.

52
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,766
The war with Asocan and Dreekii still hasn't ended.

53
00:01:03,166 --> 00:01:04,966
The next military expenditure is waiting to be allocated.

54
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,133
The treasury is almost empty.

55
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,800
What shall we do, Your Majesty?

56
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:15,733
I know.

57
00:01:25,033 --> 00:01:26,633
Your Majesty, don't worry.

58
00:01:27,133 --> 00:01:28,233
I have a plan.

59
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:31,733
Lord Weiyang, please allocate one hundred billion to me.

60
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:35,566
I can squeeze ten trillion out of the AstralPact market.

61
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,100
Lord Soul Eater,

62
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,600
How can one hundred billion become ten trillion?

63
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:47,766
For this scheme, we'll need both the Wolf King and the Crocodile King.

64
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:52,800
Let's first buy the AstralPact on the Wolf King's exchange

65
00:01:54,133 --> 00:01:57,100
and then sell them at a lower price in batches.

66
00:01:58,133 --> 00:01:59,800
We lose one hundred billion.

67
00:02:00,433 --> 00:02:04,633
The entire market's value on paper will drop by thirty trillion.

68
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,900
Thirty trillion wiped off the books.

69
00:02:08,833 --> 00:02:09,766
Where's the money?

70
00:02:11,833 --> 00:02:13,533
We have to wait for them to sell it.

71
00:02:14,433 --> 00:02:15,833
Among the ten holders,

72
00:02:16,033 --> 00:02:17,900
at least seven of them can't hold on.

73
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,133
Once they sell at a loss,

74
00:02:21,766 --> 00:02:23,766
The losses borne by ordinary people alone,

75
00:02:24,433 --> 00:02:25,766
According to my estimate,

76
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,166
will amount to ten trillion.

77
00:02:34,900 --> 00:02:37,400
Whatever purchasing power the market loses,

78
00:02:38,333 --> 00:02:40,400
the central bank will make up the shortfall.

79
00:02:45,933 --> 00:02:47,833
The various leopard kings are also in the market.

80
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:51,200
What if he comes to me for losses?

81
00:02:53,566 --> 00:02:55,733
What about the positions of the Wolf King?

82
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,533
The people's money is split 30–70.

83
00:02:59,133 --> 00:03:01,400
The gentry's money is returned in full.

84
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:06,133
Lord Crocodile King can draw up a list

85
00:03:06,766 --> 00:03:08,300
Of the newly printed ten trillion,

86
00:03:08,766 --> 00:03:10,433
three trillion into the treasury.

87
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:13,300
Seven trillion will be allocated according to the list.

88
00:03:14,633 --> 00:03:17,000
Whatever the princes and the Wolf King lose,

89
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,200
they will be fully compensated.

90
00:03:22,566 --> 00:03:25,733
But once we've pulled this off,

91
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:30,433
it'll take three to five years for people to forget.

92
00:03:31,766 --> 00:03:32,933
So what?

93
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,200
Earning enough money for five years at once.

94
00:03:38,833 --> 00:03:42,733
Isn't it good to goof off at work for the next four years?

95
00:03:44,333 --> 00:03:46,200
With Hosum currency appreciating,

96
00:03:46,833 --> 00:03:48,566
I'll go hunting overseas.

97
00:03:51,966 --> 00:03:56,966
The young wolves staying on Hosum can take a few years to rest, too.

98
00:04:01,333 --> 00:04:02,733
The banquet will still be held.

